# Gradle wrapper line endings.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true`, which
# would hand every Windows clone a CRLF `gradlew`. A shell script with CRLF
# fails under sh/bash/WSL with `\r: command not found`, so the wrapper needs
# explicit endings rather than the checkout default.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Everything else is left to core.autocrlf for now; normalising the whole tree
# is a separate, reviewable change.